ician but also your commitment to respecting and celebrating the traditions of Pacific Islander music while making it accessible to a wider audience. I would love to hear more about the specific influences that shaped your remix album and how you chose which traditional melodies to incorporate into your work. Your creative choices must carry a narrative that speaks to your personal journey, as well as a collective story that resonates with listeners across different cultural backgrounds.\n\nInformation needed:\n[{\"description\": \"What events have I attended recently that involved music or sound?\", \"id\": \"recent_events\"}]"
